    "mp3": "voice/01.mp3",
    "duration": 3.458
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Держитесь!",
    "en": "Hold on tight!",
    "fr": "Accrochez-vous !"
   },
   "source": "Mechanics/RaidInstances/FerrisRaid/CutScene/General_Text.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "start": 27.0,
   "duration": 13.0,
   "speaker": "genera-3",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_GeneralMarianna01",
    "wave": "CS_FR_GeneralMarianna01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/02.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/02.mp3",
    "duration": 2.418
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Думаешь? Какой в этом смысл?",
    "en": "You think so? But what for?",
    "fr": "Vous croyez ? Mais pourquoi ?"
   },
   "source": "Mechanics/RaidInstances/FerrisRaid/CutScene/General_text_2.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "start": 32.0,
   "duration": 13.0,
   "speaker": "genera-3",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_GeneralRysina02",
    "wave": "CS_FR_GeneralRysina02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/03.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/03.mp3",
    "duration": 7.673
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Слишком уж сложный мир у этих «слуг Порядка».",
    "en": "These \"servants of Order\" live in a world way too complicated.",
    "fr": "Ces « serviteurs de l'Ordre » vivent dans un monde bien trop compliqué."
   },
   "source": "Mechanics/RaidInstances/FerrisRaid/CutScene/General_text_3.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "start": 36.0,
   "duration": 5.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": null,
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "А я предпочитаю простые и надёжные решения!"
   },
   "source": "Mechanics/RaidInstances/FerrisRaid/CutScene/General_text_4.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "start": 42.0,
   "duration": 6.0,
   "speaker": "genera-3",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_GeneralMarianna02",
    "wave": "CS_FR_GeneralMarianna02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/05.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/05.mp3",
    "duration": 4.256
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Чем проще, тем надёжней, да? Не спорю. Приступим?",
    "en": "The simpler it is, the safer, right? So let's get going!",
    "fr": "Le plus simple est le plus sûr, non ? Alors, allons-y !"
   },
   "source": "Mechanics/RaidInstances/FerrisRaid/CutScene/General_text_5.(ClientData).xdb"
  }
 ],
